0418"}
{"type":"assistant.message","data":{"messageId":"2b8610be-f1c7-421b-a28d-2d2b2a6e255e","originatingMessageId":"99cfe6e2-da8b-4a15-b9f1-22cfebee8fc2","model":"claude-sonnet-5.5","providerId":"copilot","content":"`agent-shell` and five other custom-components records are now audited, and their API pages show real audit tables instead of \"Not audited\". I did not look at the pages in a browser. The full audit and the importer tests pass.\n\n- **What was wrong:** the audit only covered the core records, so none of the plugin components were ever included.\n- **What's now covered:** `agent-shell`, `banner`, `button-set`, `logo`, `segmented-control` and `skeleton-loader`. The pages load the plugin's stylesheet, and the list lives in `formats/components/scripts/audit-plugin-components.ts`.\n- **agent-shell:** it was the only one of the six missing guidance, so I added an `@a11y` block and an `-automatica11y` example (a labelled `<section>`). The other five already had both.\n- **Guard test:** a new test requires every plugin record to have `@a11y` text and an audit example.\n- **Snapshot:** I re-ran the whole audit and re-imported it. The snapshot went from 76 to 82 records.\n\nA few things you might trip over:\n- **Left out:** the plugin's `ai-gradient` is still unaudited. It's a utility, not a component, and it has no `@a11y` text or examples. It also has the same name as a core record. Say if you want it included. `card` was already covered through core, and `segmented-control.segment` has no page of its own.\n- **Not covered:** the layouts plugin pages (callout, hero and similar) are still \"Not audited\", per your choice of custom-components only.\n- **Changeset:** I added one for `@pantoken/plugin-custom-components`. It covers the `agent-shell` guidance.\n- **Snapshot diff:** the snapshot file shows a large diff because the full run replaced all of its contents.\n- **CI:** I haven't re-run it on any of these changes.","toolRequests":[],"interactionId":"13d1d66b-1a27-42a1-a76c-b2ac94a56693","turnId":"59","rte":true,"apiCallId":"msg_011CgV9dya65wCp2xqEr24dZ"},"id":"8aa71410-59c6-4605-9278-bca38d884171","timestamp":"2026-10-28T18:59:52.080Z","parentId":"387bd3fe-d408-4539-9ece-b27d5a88815b"}
