{"type":"tool.execution_complete","data":{"toolCallId":"toolu_01Ue3dUm1cZESqnR5s6Jwryk","model":"claude-sonnet-5.5","interactionId":"b4f03ceb-0b21-44ca-9a3e-694263c338bd","turnId":"1","rte":true,"shellExecution":{"exitCode":0},"success":true,"result":{"content":"==> docs/api/css/color.md <==\n# CSS: color\n\n`.--text-danger` — Semantic colour utilities: `.--bg-<name>`, `.--text-<name>` (aliased as `.--color-<name>`), and `.--border-<name>` for the curated semantic palette. Every one of these also has a co\n\n**Source:** [generate.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/scripts/generate.ts)\n\n==> docs/api/css/primitives.md <==\n# CSS: primitives\n\n`.instui-bg-primitive-color-white` — Opt-in utility classes for the raw primitive palette: `.instui-bg-`/`fg-`/`border-primitive-color-<name>` paint a colour from the primitive colour tokens, plus `fo\n\n**Group:** Plugins · **Source:** [generate.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/plugins/pantoken/primitives/scripts/generate.ts)\n\n==> docs/api/css/base.md <==\n# CSS: base\n\n`*` — The opt-in global reset: `box-sizing`, the page surface, base text colour and font, `color-scheme`, and link defaults.\n\n**Source:** [base.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/rules/base/base.css)\n\n==> docs/api/css/breakpoints.md <==\n# CSS: breakpoints\n\n`.breakpoints` — Extra-small viewport width for phone-sized previews.\n\n## Usage\n\n==> docs/api/css/maskglobal.md <==\n# CSS: maskglobal\n\n`.--mask-overlay` — A global, dual copy of the `mask` component's overlay modifiers — `--mask-overlay`, `--mask-fullscreen`, `--mask-blur` — usable bare or chained onto any component, without wrapping\n\n**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/mask/index.ts)\nimport type { Definition } from \"../lib/define.ts\";\nimport { base } from \"./base/index.ts\";\nimport { prose } from \"./prose/index.ts\";\n\nexport const RULES: readonly Definition[] = [base, prose];\nimport type { Definition } from \"../lib/define.ts\";\nimport { focus } from \"./focus/index.ts\";\nimport { elevation } from \"./elevation/index.ts\";\n\nexport const DECLARATIONS: readonly Definition[] = [focus, elevation];\nutilities/icon/icon.css a11y=1 ex=2 auto=1\nutilities/screen-reader-content/screen-reader-content.css a11y=1 ex=2 auto=1\nutilities/transition/transition.css a11y=1 ex=1 auto=0\nutilities/visual-debug/visual-debug.css a11y=1 ex=1 auto=0\nrules/base/base.css a11y=1 ex=1 auto=0\ngrep: declarations/*/*.css: No such file or directory\ngrep: declarations/*/*.css: No such file or directory\ngrep: declarations/*/*.css: No such file or directory\ndeclarations/*/*.css a11y= ex= auto=\n<shellId: 197 completed with exit code 0>"},"toolTelemetry":{"properties":{"customTimeout":"false","executionMode":"sync","detached":"false","sandboxApplied":"false","sandboxOptOutRequested":"false"},"metrics":{"commandTimeout":30000.0,"context_token_limit":200000.0,"context_current_tokens":117517.0,"large_output_threshold_bytes":8192.0,"result_token_count":802}}},"id":"de61efe2-a89b-4924-8733-3f179bce166b","timestamp":"2026-10-28T19:08:29.713Z","parentId":"90f9b615-2c40-4b3a-9197-4494ac55d221"}
