{"type":"tool.execution_complete","data":{"toolCallId":"toolu_01QV2JqPrX1mm6bQmZ1Se1e1","model":"claude-sonnet-5.5","interactionId":"b4f03ceb-0b21-44ca-9a3e-694263c338bd","turnId":"5","rte":true,"shellExecution":{"exitCode":0},"success":true,"result":{"content":"formats/components/scripts/generate.ts\n# CSS: color\n\n`.--text-danger` — Semantic colour utilities: `.--bg-<name>`, `.--text-<name>` (aliased as `.--color-<name>`), and `.--border-<name>` for the curated semantic palette. Every one of these also has a component-attached alias modifier (for example `-bg-danger` on any `.instui-<component>`).\n\n**Source:** [generate.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/scripts/generate.ts)\n\n## Usage\n\n```css\n@import \"@pantoken/components/utilities.css\";\n```\n\n## Examples\n\n```html\n<p class=\"--text-danger\">Something went wrong.</p>\n```\n\n## Modifiers\n\n| Modifier | Description |\n| --- | --- |\n| `.--text-danger` | Applies the semantic danger text colour. |\n| `.--bg-*` | Background colour utilities for semantic and component-aligned names. |\n| `.--border-*` | Border colour utilities for semantic and component-aligned names. |\n| `.--color-*` | Alias of `--text-*` for text colour utilities. |\n| `.--text-*` | Text colour utilities for semantic and component-aligned names. |\n\n## Tokens consumed\n<shellId: 201 completed with exit code 0>"},"toolTelemetry":{"properties":{"customTimeout":"false","executionMode":"sync","detached":"false","sandboxApplied":"false","sandboxOptOutRequested":"false"},"metrics":{"commandTimeout":30000.0,"context_token_limit":200000.0,"context_current_tokens":123027.0,"large_output_threshold_bytes":8192.0,"result_token_count":340}}},"id":"7fdbe611-3df1-4e74-810d-ed42c0e6a488","timestamp":"2026-10-28T19:09:02.973Z","parentId":"7b97fa2f-f5ea-484c-8cb3-fae4996a8e17"}
