{"type":"tool.execution_start","data":{"toolCallId":"toolu_01KdmPT9UdhrmxqVzvJ2MtR3","toolName":"edit","arguments":{"new_str":" * @a11y Hiding content at a breakpoint also hides it from assistive tech, so don't hide the only way to complete a task, and keep the shown and hidden versions equivalent in meaning.\n * @example -automatica11y\n * \\`\\`\\`html\n * <p class=\"instui-hidden-max-sm\">The full course description appears on larger screens.</p>\n * <p class=\"instui-show-min-sm\">The full course description appears on larger screens.</p>\n * \\`\\`\\`\n * @example\n * <div class=\"instui-hidden-max-sm\">Hidden at or below the small breakpoint.</div>","old_str":" * @example\n * <div class=\"instui-hidden-max-sm\">Hidden at or below the small breakpoint.</div>","path":"/Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/formats/components/src/utilities/responsive/index.ts"},"turnId":"12","model":"claude-sonnet-5.5","toolTitle":"Editing file"},"id":"a9a93ca8-753d-4664-ac14-521db86ac4ee","timestamp":"2026-10-28T19:10:13.325Z","parentId":"6a38f3c6-3fb4-4396-97c3-1e0c5dc1ea87"}
{"type":"hook.start","data":{"hookInvocationId":"ee625c10-ef67-4291-9eed-7cabc29ac7c1","hookType":"preToolUse","input":{"sessionId":"cf8db52f-0f27-4d51-8f45-3f9af32eb056","cwd":"/Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken","toolCalls":[{"id":"toolu_01RiVfnA4UKc56CJ151RJ9ov","name":"edit","args":{"new_str":" * @a11y A scrollable region must work from the keyboard: give it \\`tabindex=\"0\"\\`, a role, and an accessible name (or make sure it contains a focusable control). Don't use \\`hidden\\` or \\`clip\\` to cut off content people need to read.\n * @example -automatica11y\n * \\`\\`\\`html\n * <div class=\"--overflow-y-auto\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Release notes\" style=\"block-size: 5rem\">\n *   <p>Version 2.4 adds keyboard shortcuts for the gradebook.</p>\n *   <p>Version 2.3 fixes focus order in the course menu.</p>\n *   <p>Version 2.2 improves contrast in dark mode.</p>\n *   <p>Version 2.1 updates the file upload messages.</p>\n * </div>\n * \\`\\`\\`\n * @example\n * <div class=\"--overflow-y-auto\">…</div>","old_str":" * @example\n * <div class=\"--overflow-y-auto\">…</div>","path":"/Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/formats/components/src/utilities/overflow/index.ts"}},{"id":"toolu_0164YGWm5gwT3Ly6oVEz9ZgV","name":"edit","args":{"new_str":" * @a11y Spacing is visual only: use it to keep text and controls from crowding, not to convey structure — use headings, lists, and landmarks for that. Leave enough space around interactive targets for WCAG 2.5.8, and don't rely on fixed spacing that breaks when users increase text spacing.\n * @example -automatica11y\n * \\`\\`\\`html\n * <div class=\"--p-md --mt-lg\">\n *   <h2>Office hours</h2>\n *   <p>Mondays and Wednesdays, 2–4 pm.</p>\n * </div>\n * \\`\\`\\`\n * @example\n * <div class=\"--p-md --mt-lg\">Padded box with a large top margin.</div>","old_str":" * @example\n * <div class=\"--p-md --mt-lg\">Padded box with a large top margin.</div>","path":"/Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/formats/components/src/utilities/spacing/index.ts"}},{"id":"toolu_01QLDzkJnZcxVbLsv1A6fztD","name":"edit","args":{"new_str":" * @a11y A gap changes spacing only; reading and focus order still follow the DOM. Keep gaps between interactive controls large enough to meet WCAG 2.5.8 target spacing.\n * @example -automatica11y\n * \\`\\`\\`html\n * <div class=\"--display-flex --gap-sm\">\n *   <button class=\"instui-button\">Save</button>\n *   <button class=\"instui-button\">Cancel</button>\n * </div>\n * \\`\\`\\`\n * @example\n * <div class=\"--display-flex --gap-sm\">","old_str":" * @example\n * <div class=\"--display-flex --gap-sm\">","path":"/Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/formats/components/src/utilities/gap/index.ts"}},{"id":"toolu_01NRgFH98eFbzeTscezmfeiD","name":"edit","args":{"new_str":" * @a11y \\`--display-none\\` removes an element from the accessibility tree as well as the screen, so use it only for content nobody needs. Flex and grid layout can't reorder content for assistive tech; keep the DOM order meaningful, and don't center or justify long passages of text.\n * @example -automatica11y\n * \\`\\`\\`html\n * <div class=\"--display-flex --text-align-center\">\n *   <span>Course</span>\n *   <span>Grades</span>\n * </div>\n * \\`\\`\\`\n * @example\n * <div class=\"--display-flex --text-align-center\">","old_str":" * @example\n * <div class=\"--display-flex --text-align-center\">","path":"/Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/formats/components/src/utilities/layout/index.ts"}},{"id":"toolu_01QrC4t6MjhmawdE4YtNpZ7Z","name":"edit","args":{"new_str":" * @a11y Positioning changes where content appears, not where it sits in the DOM: keep the visual order matching the reading and focus order, and don't let positioned content cover a focused control.\n * @example -automatica11y\n * \\`\\`\\`html\n * <div class=\"--position-relative\">\n *   <p>Positioned content stays in reading order.</p>\n * </div>\n * \\`\\`\\`\n * @example\n * <div class=\"--position-relative\">…</div>","old_str":" * @example\n * <div class=\"--position-relative\">…</div>","path":"/Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/formats/components/src/utilities/position/index.ts"}},{"id":"toolu_013pPXETXnpwHsi2NXmv27dH","name":"edit","args":{"new_str":" * @a11y Stacking order is visual only: a layered surface that covers focusable content hides the focus indicator. Overlays that take over the page also need focus management and an accessible name.\n * @example -automatica11y\n * \\`\\`\\`html\n * <div class=\"--stack-above\">\n *   <p>Content raised above the default flow.</p>\n * </div>\n * \\`\\`\\`\n * @example\n * <div class=\"--stack-topmost\">Always on top.</div>","old_str":" * @example\n * <div class=\"--stack-topmost\">Always on top.</div>","path":"/Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/formats/components/src/utilities/stacking/index.ts"}},{"id":"toolu_01LTXgJgfwXvTwG9eeDnum1D","name":"edit","args":{"new_str":" * @a11y The cursor only affects pointer users; a pointer cursor doesn't make an element operable. Put it on native controls (\\`button\\`, \\`a\\`), and never use \\`--cursor-not-allowed\\` or \\`--cursor-wait\\` as the only sign that something is disabled or busy.\n * @example -automatica11y\n * \\`\\`\\`html\n * <button class=\"instui-button --cursor-pointer\">Open details</button>\n * \\`\\`\\`\n * @example\n * <div class=\"--cursor-pointer\">…</div>","old_str":" * @example\n * <div class=\"--cursor-pointer\">…</div>","path":"/Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/formats/components/src/utilities/cursor/index.ts"}},{"id":"toolu_01H7TPDJqssnH4d6vgnGBPvx","name":"edit","args":{"new_str":" * @a11y A mask covers content visually but doesn't block assistive tech or the keyboard: make the covered region \\`inert\\` (or mark it \\`aria-busy\\`), keep the mask's own message as real text, and don't hide the focus indicator behind it.\n * @example -automatica11y\n * \\`\\`\\`html\n * <div class=\"--position-relative\" style=\"min-block-size: 4rem\">\n *   <p>Gradebook</p>\n *   <div class=\"--mask-overlay\" role=\"status\">Loading grades…</div>\n * </div>\n * \\`\\`\\`\n * @example\n * <button class=\"instui-button --mask-overlay\">…</button>","old_str":" * @example\n * <button class=\"instui-button --mask-overlay\">…</button>","path":"/Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/formats/components/src/utilities/mask/index.ts"}},{"id":"toolu_01KdmPT9UdhrmxqVzvJ2MtR3","name":"edit","args":{"new_str":" * @a11y Hiding content at a breakpoint also hides it from assistive tech, so don't hide the only way to complete a task, and keep the shown and hidden versions equivalent in meaning.\n * @example -automatica11y\n * \\`\\`\\`html\n * <p class=\"instui-hidden-max-sm\">The full course description appears on larger screens.</p>\n * <p class=\"instui-show-min-sm\">The full course description appears on larger screens.</p>\n * \\`\\`\\`\n * @example\n * <div class=\"instui-hidden-max-sm\">Hidden at or below the small breakpoint.</div>","old_str":" * @example\n * <div class=\"instui-hidden-max-sm\">Hidden at or below the small breakpoint.</div>","path":"/Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/formats/components/src/utilities/responsive/index.ts"}}]}},"id":"63ed6177-83af-40dc-b0dd-31a3ed668115","timestamp":"2026-10-28T19:10:13.331Z","parentId":"a9a93ca8-753d-4664-ac14-521db86ac4ee"}
