erty --timing — Animation timing function (default `ease-in-out`).\\\\n+ * @example -automatica11y\\\\n+ * ```html\\\\n+ * <div class=\\\\\\\"instui-transition -transition-fade-entered\\\\\\\">Animated content</div>\\\\n+ * ```\\\\n  * @example\\\\n  * <div class=\\\\\\\"instui-transition -transition-fade-entering\\\\\\\">Animated content</div>\\\\n  */\\\\n\\\",\\n  \\\"newFileContents\\\": \\\"/**\\\\n * @utility transition\\\\n * @selector .pfx-transition.-transition-fade-entering\\\\n * @modifier -transition-* — Transition type/state class toggled by runtime (`fade|scale|slide-*` + `entering|entered|exiting|exited`).\\\\n * @global\\\\n * @a11y The classes only animate, so provide a `prefers-reduced-motion` alternative for large movement and don't convey essential state through the transition alone.\\\\n * @summary Animation state classes for the `Transition` component — `.instui-transition` and state classes (`-transition-fade-entering`, `-transition-scale-exited`, etc.) — usable bare or chained onto any component.\\\\n * @cssproperty --duration — Animation duration (default `300ms`); override to speed up or slow down every transition state.\\\\n * @cssproperty --timing — Animation timing function (default `ease-in-out`).\\\\n * @example -automatica11y\\\\n * ```html\\\\n * <div class=\\\\\\\"instui-transition -transition-fade-entered\\\\\\\">Animated content</div>\\\\n * ```\\\\n * @example\\\\n * <div class=\\\\\\\"instui-transition -transition-fade-entering\\\\\\\">Animated content</div>\\\\n */\\\\n@property --duration {\\\\n  syntax: \\\\\\\"<time>\\\\\\\";\\\\n  inherits: true;\\\\n  initial-value: 300ms;\\\\n}\\\\n\\\\n@property --timing {\\\\n  syntax: \\\\\\\"*\\\\\\\";\\\\n  inherits: true;\\\\n  initial-value: ease-in-out;\\\\n}\\\\n\\\\n@scope (.pfx-transition) {\\\\n  & {\\\\n    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {\\\\n      transition:\\\\n        opacity var(--duration) var(--timing),\\\\n        transform var(--duration) var(--timing);\\\\n    }\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  &.-transition-fade-exiting,\\\\n  &.-transition-fade-exited {\\\\n    opacity: 0.01;\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  &.-transition-fade-entering,\\\\n  &.-transition-fade-entered {\\\\n    opacity: 1;\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  &.-transition-scale-exiting,\\\\n  &.-transition-scale-exited {\\\\n    transform: scale(0.01) translate3d(0, 0, 0);\\\\n    opacity: 0.01;\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  &.-transition-scale-entering,\\\\n  &.-transition-scale-entered {\\\\n    transform: scale(1) translate3d(0, 0, 0);\\\\n    opacity: 1;\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  &.-transition-slide-right-exited,\\\\n  &.-transition-slide-left-exited,\\\\n  &.-transition-slide-up-exited,\\\\n  &.-transition-slide-down-exited {… [truncated 843 chars]\\\",\\n  \\\"canOfferSessionApproval\\\": true,\\n  \\\"_permissionRequestSessionId\\\": \\\"cf8db52f-0f27-4d51-8f45-3f9af32eb056\\\"\\n}\\n```\\n\\nRaw permission request:\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\\"kind\\\": \\\"write\\\",\\n  \\\"toolCallId\\\": \\\"toolu_013tXtoyyFb4UP9Pj4P7TLnh\\\",\\n  \\\"intention\\\": \\\"Edit file\\\",\\n  \\\"fileName\\\": \\\"/Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/formats/components/src/utilities/transition/transition.css\\\",\\n  \\\"diff\\\": \\\"\\\\ndiff --git a/Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/formats/components/src/utilities/transition/transition.css b/Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/formats/components/src/utilities/transition/transition.css\\\\nindex 0000000..0000000 100644\\\\n--- a/Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/formats/components/src/utilities/transition/transition.css\\\\n+++ b/Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/formats/components/src/utilities/transition/transition.css\\\\n@@ -7,6 +7,10 @@\\\\n  * @summary Animation state classes for the `Transition` component — `.instui-transition` and state classes (`-transition-fade-entering`, `-transition-scale-exited`, etc.) — usable bare or chained onto any component.\\\\n  * @cssproperty --duration — Animation duration (default `300ms`); override to speed up or slow down every transition state.\\\\n  