 **Left out:** the plugin's `ai-gradient` is still unaudited. It's a utility, not a component, and it has no `@a11y` text or examples. It also has the same name as a core record. Say if you want it included. `card` was already covered through core, and `segmented-control.segment` has no page of its own. - **Not covered:** the layouts plugin pages (callout, hero and similar) are still \\\"Not audited\\\", per your choice of custom-components only. - **Changeset:** I added one for `@pantoken/plugin-custom-components`. It covers the `agent-shell` guidance. - **Snapshot diff:** the snapshot file shows a large diff because the full run replaced all of its contents. - **CI:** I haven't re-run it on any of these changes.\\n[human #20] layout plugin doesn't need to be covered. for both components and custom-components go through the utilities, declarations, etc. and add those audits where applicable.\\n[context] <current_datetime>2026-10-28T13:08:05.474-06:00</current_datetime> layout plugin doesn't need to be covered. for both components and custom-components go through the utilities, declarations, etc. and add those audits where applicable.\\n[tool bash -> success] args={\\\"command\\\":\\\"cd /Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken && grep -L \\\\\\\"pantoken-a11y-table\\\\\\\" docs/api/css/*.md | xargs -n1 basename; sed -n 1,60p formats/components/src/components/index.ts | head -60; cat formats/components/src/utilities/index.ts | head -40; ls formats/components/src/declarations plugins/pantoken/custom-components/src/declarations\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"List unaudited pages and source buckets\\\"}\\n[tool bash -> success] args={\\\"command\\\":\\\"cd /Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken && head -5 docs/api/css/color.md docs/api/css/primitives.md docs/api/css/base.md docs/api/css/breakpoints.md docs/api/css/maskglobal.md | cut -c1-200; cat formats/components/src/rules/index.ts | grep -v \\\\\\\"^ \\\\\\\\*\\\\\\\\|^/\\\\\\\\*\\\\\\\" ; cat formats/components/src/declarations/index.ts 