{"type":"model.message","data":{"kind":"message","turn":0,"modelCall":{"model":"gpt-6-luna","api_id":"","api_endpoint":"/responses","request_id":"A041:319282:38CDFF6:3BF3BF5:6AE248CB","client_request_id":"00000-d7f698b7-a78c-44e4-ae90-61b8e207c33f","service_request_id":"4c173f53-2b01-4014-b5f8-6fb6f183b9fe","rte":true,"initiator":"user","transport":"http"},"message":{"content":"ALLOW: Adds the previously excluded utility to audit coverage, as requested.","refusal":null,"role":"assistant","reasoning_opaque":"REDACTED","reasoning_text":"I’m thinking about the need to evaluate a code change that involves removing the exclusion mask from audit records. The user asked about audit utilities, and adding this directly to the audit might have mandatory implications. It seems like a modification rather than a complete disablement. There’s concern about possibly duplicating names in the components, which might lead to improper processing in the audit. I need to ensure I provide a concise reason for this project change.","encrypted_content":"REDACTED","reasoningBlocks":{"provider":"openai-responses","blocks":[{"content":[],"encrypted_content":"REDACTED","id":"","summary":[{"text":"**Evaluating code modifications**\n\nI’m thinking about the need to evaluate a code change that involves removing the exclusion mask from audit records. The user asked about audit utilities, and adding this directly to the audit might have mandatory implications. It seems like a modification rather than a complete disablement. There’s concern about possibly duplicating names in the components, which might lead to improper processing in the audit. I need to ensure I provide a concise reason for this project change.","type":"summary_text"}],"type":"reasoning"}]},"responses_message_status":"completed","phase":"final_answer","serverTools":{"provider":"openai-responses"},"apiCallId":"","outputTokens":154,"providerId":"copilot"}},"id":"cf5e4b7b-cb3a-4134-b26f-12e6c5a0dd70","timestamp":"2026-10-28T19:11:12.0