{"type":"assistant.message","data":{"messageId":"c949ab1d-bccd-4111-89ca-d9f70c3f1c73","originatingMessageId":"73c76ac7-38c1-4a1e-a8f8-81f01d04ec99","model":"claude-sonnet-5.5","providerId":"copilot","content":"The utilities, rules and custom components are now audited. The snapshot went from 82 to 97 records. The full audit passed on every tier. Docs tests (411) and the audit and guard tests pass. I haven't run remote CI or looked at the rendered pages in a browser.\n\n**What's now covered**\n- **Utilities:** spacing, gap, layout, responsive, position, overflow, cursor, stacking, mask, truncate, transition, visual-debug and ai-gradient. Each has `@a11y` guidance and an `-automatica11y` example.\n- **Rules:** base and prose.\n- **Plugin components:** agent-shell, banner, button-set, logo, segmented-control and skeleton-loader (from the earlier round).\n- **Guard test:** it now checks every audited record for `@a11y` text and an audit example.\n\n**Skipped**\n- elevation (shadow only, no markup)\n- breakpoints (preview widths)\n- primitives (arbitrary palette)\n- segmented-control.segment (covered by its parent)\n- the layouts plugin (per your instruction)\n- `color`, which has no source record and needs a separate decision (see below)\n\n**Things to know**\n- The plugin and core `ai-gradient` records share a name, so only the core one is audited.\n- `color` comes from a generated doc block in `formats/components/scripts/generate.ts`. To audit it, I'd add its `@a11y` text and example there and feed it into the audit. Say if you want that.\n- `l10n/docs.api.pot` still needs regenerating. It's modified by another agent, so I left it alone.\n- The HTML audit tables aren't translated.\n\n**Commits**\n- `f01865d21`: the source docs and examples, the audit wiring, the guard test and the changeset `.changeset/audit-utilities-rules.md`.\n- `7abacedba`: the refreshed snapshot and the updated record-count test.","toolRequests":[],"interactionId":"b4f03ceb-0b21-44ca-9a3e-694263c338bd","turnId":"34","rte":true,"apiCallId":"msg_011CgVDr35ymrvTVQjhwxd6c"},"id":"2501f9da-9106-41f1-aa46-0863aed31cb6","timestamp":"2026-10-28T19:55:02.339Z","parentId":"93b28bce-82b5-49c2-acd1-0a1a74f55938"}
